WEBVTT

00:00:59.516 --> 00:01:01.076
And everywhere I went,

00:01:01.076 --> 00:01:06.316
I was met with, "Oh, so cute,
so inspirational."

00:01:06.836 --> 00:01:11.636
And yeah, I guess two little girls
and a bunch of friends

00:01:11.676 --> 00:01:15.156
trying to make a difference
is pretty special.

00:01:15.556 --> 00:01:16.996
But you know what?

00:01:17.396 --> 00:01:19.716
Cute wasn't really what I was going for.

00:01:20.116 --> 00:01:22.676
I slowly learned to build a team,

00:01:22.676 --> 00:01:25.356
to gather evidence, create campaigns,

00:01:25.396 --> 00:01:28.076
develop a movement,
to stage beach cleanups

00:01:28.116 --> 00:01:29.356
collect signatures,

00:01:29.396 --> 00:01:31.676
speak in public and meet politicians.